      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>&hellip; good fortune (<i>khayra</i>)</li>\n<li>&hellip; entirely</li>\n<li>&hellip; [i]f it twitches</li>\n<li>&hellip; he will [ob]tain great good fortune.</li>\n<li>&hellip; [if] the head of the penis (<i>kummara</i>) twitch, a child</li>\n<li>&hellip; If there twitches</li>\n<li>&hellip; the right, then h[e]</li>\n<li>&hellip; If there twitches</li>\n<li>&hellip; it says concerning it &hellip;</li>\n<li>&hellip; this is good &hellip;</li>\n<li>&hellip; [if there twit]ches the place of the right (\u1e25aqq) of the&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&hellip; [then h]e will become ill. If</li>\n<li>[there twitches a pl]ace on the left side,</li></ol>\n",
